Description: Let Xvnc take only viewers with a client certificate
 X509ClientCA and X509ClientCRL: the server asks for a client certificate
 and takes only certificates of that authority whose extended key usage
 names TLS client authentication. Only the X509 security types are offered
 then. Backport from github.com/schlaile/tigervnc, branch client-cert.
Author: Peter Schlaile <peter@schlaile.de>
